{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy 12 games in one with the perfect reproduction of real pinball machines, with all kinds of graphic details and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover all the secrets, in these thrilling games, a great challenge awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete all the missions and become number 1 in the world or the best among your Friends, posting your high score on the online leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Arcade design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- More than 8 missions to accomplish for game! Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiball, Extraball, Skillshot, Jackpots...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Reproduction with all the details, lights and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4 different cameras to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Vertical Gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Online Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you prefer, you can also purchase them separately in the Steam Store.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3297230?t=1742806986","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297230/ef8e89bce770529b4c420c5fdb6427f3c64d290b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742806986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297230/98808873b1aedc786501c19d59b76a95c019e4c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742806986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297230/98808873b1aedc786501c19d59b76a95c019e4c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742806986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy 12 games in one with the perfect reproduction of real pinball machines, with all kinds of graphic details and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover all the secrets, in these thrilling games, a great challenge awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete all the missions and become number 1 in the world or the best among your Friends, posting your high score on the online leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Arcade design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- More than 8 missions to accomplish for game! Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiball, Extraball, Skillshot, Jackpots...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Reproduction with all the details, lights and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 4 different cameras to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Vertical Gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Online Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you prefer, you can also purchase them separately in the Steam Store.</p>","developers":["Super PowerUp Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297230/6f1d5e7629d3e81867a5bca0bc318c8a3a50c230/header.jpg?t=1742806986","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Super PowerUp Games S.L.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Pinball Jam","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX650 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=